{"version":1,"content":"<p>現年40歲的藝人謝東閔早前曾傳出與陳庭欣墮愛河，兩位當事人雙雙否認，謝東閔更直言工作太忙暫時無暇考慮感情事，自己亦不着急拍拖。</p><p>而近日他被發現於廣州開設餐廳，且親自落舖招呼客人，相當敬業，似乎深信力不到不為財。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T04:09:29.010133+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T03:16:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T04:02:52.374268+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T04:02:52.374268+00:00","content_hash":"86277d64a8d5ae1ce093adc3e2eb2e79a60638fc70217ce7a6a38f514fe9d8f5","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}